\label{lemma-image-affine-finite-morphism-affine-Noetherian}
Let $f : Y \to X$ be a morphism of schemes.
Assume
\begin{enumerate}
\item $f$ finite,
\item $f$ surjective,
\item $Y$ affine, and
\item $X$ Noetherian.
\end{enumerate}
Then $X$ is affine.

